# ${project.name}

`${project.artifactId}` is an archetype which generates a sample Maven site written in Markdown, including a page filtered through Velocity, and demonstrates how to i18n your site:

```

project
|-- .mvn
|   |-- jvm.config
|   `-- maven.config
|-- pom.xml
`-- src
    `-- site
        |-- fr
        |   `-- markdown
        |       |-- index.md
        |       |-- markdown.md
        |       `-- markdown-velocity.md.vm
        |-- markdown
        |   |-- index.md
        |   |-- markdown.md
        |   `-- markdown-velocity.md.vm
        |-- site_fr.xml
        `-- site.xml
```

This archetype can be layered upon an existing Maven project.

Usage
-----

To generate a new project from this archetype, type:

```

mvn archetype:generate -DarchetypeGroupId=${project.groupId} -DarchetypeArtifactId=${project.artifactId} -DarchetypeVersion=${project.version}
```
